{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54014","headline":"伤淘者 · 郑玘","name":"伤淘者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"披沙辛苦见伤怀，往往分毫望亦乖。\n力尽半年深水里，难全爲一凤凰钗。\n（《太平御览》卷八一一引《岭表录异》，又见四库本《岭表录异》卷上）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑玘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54014.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54014","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}